        <pre><code>γ = (γ₁, γ₂): complex shear
γ₁ = (g₁₁ - g₂₂)/2 (stretching)
γ₂ = g₁₂ (shearing)
g_ij: reduced shear tensor
Measured from galaxy shapes</code></pre>
