    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Definition</h3>
        <pre><code>κ = Σ/Σ_crit: dimensionless surface density
Σ: projected surface density
Σ_crit: critical surface density
κ = 1: strong lensing
κ < 1: weak lensing</code></pre>
